{"seq":2,"slug":"distillation-fewstep","title":"蒸馏与少步采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-models/sampling/distillation-fewstep","wordCount":1783,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"蒸馏与少步采样\">蒸馏与少步采样</h1><p><a href=\"samplers-schedulers\">采样器与调度</a> 把步数从一千压到二十多，靠的是更聪明地解那条 ODE，但这条路有个下界：再高阶的求解器，到个位数步也会因为 ODE 轨迹的弯曲而崩。要冲破这个下界、做到一到四步出图，必须换思路——不再优化怎么解轨迹，而是直接训一个新模型，让它学会&quot;一步跳到终点&quot;。这就是蒸馏。它把秒级甚至亚秒级的交互式图像生成变成了 2024–2026 年的日常。本篇拥有蒸馏与少步训练的产权。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-用慢教师教出快学生\">核心概念：用慢教师教出快学生</h2><p>蒸馏的统一框架是师生范式：一个训练充分但采样慢的扩散模型当<strong>教师</strong>，一个结构相近的<strong>学生</strong>通过模仿教师的输出，学会用极少步数（甚至一步）产生同等质量的图。不同蒸馏方法的差异在于&quot;学生模仿什么&quot;以及&quot;用不用对抗&quot;。主流分三条线：一致性模型族（学 ODE 轨迹的自洽性）、对抗蒸馏族（用判别器逼真度补偿少步的细节损失）、以及把二者与整流流结合的混合方法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    TEACHER[教师扩散模型&lt;br/&gt;20-50步 高质量] --&gt; DISTILL{蒸馏方式}&#10;    DISTILL --&gt;|轨迹自洽| CM[一致性模型 CM/CD&lt;br/&gt;任意点映同一终点]&#10;    DISTILL --&gt;|潜空间一致性| LCM[LCM / LCM-LoRA&lt;br/&gt;2-4步]&#10;    DISTILL --&gt;|对抗+蒸馏| ADD[ADD / SD-Turbo&lt;br/&gt;1-4步]&#10;    DISTILL --&gt;|渐进折半| PD[渐进蒸馏&lt;br/&gt;步数逐次减半]&#10;    CM --&gt; FAST[学生模型 1-4步出图]&#10;    LCM --&gt; FAST&#10;    ADD --&gt; FAST&#10;    PD --&gt; FAST\">flowchart TD\n    TEACHER[教师扩散模型&lt;br/&gt;20-50步 高质量] --&gt; DISTILL{蒸馏方式}\n    DISTILL --&gt;|轨迹自洽| CM[一致性模型 CM/CD&lt;br/&gt;任意点映同一终点]\n    DISTILL --&gt;|潜空间一致性| LCM[LCM / LCM-LoRA&lt;br/&gt;2-4步]\n    DISTILL --&gt;|对抗+蒸馏| ADD[ADD / SD-Turbo&lt;br/&gt;1-4步]\n    DISTILL --&gt;|渐进折半| PD[渐进蒸馏&lt;br/&gt;步数逐次减半]\n    CM --&gt; FAST[学生模型 1-4步出图]\n    LCM --&gt; FAST\n    ADD --&gt; FAST\n    PD --&gt; FAST</pre><p>主流少步方法对比（数据综合自下文所列来源）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>核心机制</th>\n<th>典型步数</th>\n<th>是否用对抗</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>渐进蒸馏</td>\n<td>教师两步合学生一步，递归折半</td>\n<td>4–8</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>Progressive Distillation</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性模型</td>\n<td>强制轨迹上任意点映同一 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>1–4</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>Consistency Models</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>潜在一致性 LCM</td>\n<td>在潜空间做一致性蒸馏</td>\n<td>2–4</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>LCM, LCM-LoRA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对抗扩散蒸馏</td>\n<td>蒸馏损失+判别器</td>\n<td>1–4</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>ADD, SD-Turbo/SDXL-Turbo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整流流重流</td>\n<td>拉直 ODE 轨迹再蒸馏</td>\n<td>1–4</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n<td>Rectified Flow, PeRFlow</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"一致性模型-让轨迹处处自洽\">一致性模型：让轨迹处处自洽</h2><p>一致性模型（Consistency Models，2023）抓住了概率流 ODE 的一个性质：沿同一条 ODE 轨迹的所有点，最终都应收敛到同一个干净样本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。于是它训练一个函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_\\theta(x_t, t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，要求它把轨迹上任意时刻的点都直接映射到该轨迹的起点，并满足自洽性——相邻两个时刻的输出必须一致：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>且边界条件 </mtext><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_\\theta(x_t, t) \\approx f_\\theta(x_{t&#x27;}, t&#x27;),\\quad \\text{且边界条件 } f_\\theta(x_0, 0) = x_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.328em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6828em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">且边界条件</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>训练好后，给定纯噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，一次前向 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_\\theta(x_T, T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 就直接得到图——这就是一步生成。它也保留多步选项：想要更高质量，可以交替&quot;去噪一点、再加噪一点&quot;地迭代两到四次，用算力换质量。一致性模型既可从教师蒸馏（一致性蒸馏 CD），也可从头独立训练（CT），这点很关键，呼应了<a href=\"../foundations/generative-modeling\">生成式建模概览</a> 里&quot;一步生成&quot;那一维。</p>\n<h2 id=\"潜在一致性与对抗蒸馏\">潜在一致性与对抗蒸馏</h2><p>把一致性蒸馏直接搬到 <a href=\"../architectures/latent-diffusion\">潜在扩散与 LDM</a> 的潜空间，就是<strong>潜在一致性模型（LCM）</strong>。它能把 Stable Diffusion 蒸馏成 2–4 步出 768×768 图的快模型（<a href=\"https://www.mercity.ai/blog-post/lcm-lora-distillation-training-fast-diffusion-models/\">来源：Mercity LCM 研究</a>）。更妙的是 <strong>LCM-LoRA</strong>——把加速能力打包成一个 LoRA 插件，套到任意同底座的微调模型上即插即用，无需对每个模型单独蒸馏，这与<a href=\"../applications/controllable-generation\">可控生成与微调</a> 的 LoRA 生态无缝衔接。</p>\n<p>另一条线是<strong>对抗扩散蒸馏（ADD）</strong>，Stability AI 的 SD-Turbo / SDXL-Turbo 用的就是它。纯蒸馏在一步设定下细节会糊，ADD 的对策是把<a href=\"../foundations/generative-modeling\">生成式建模概览</a> 里被扩散淘汰的 GAN 思想请回来：在蒸馏损失之外加一个判别器，逼迫一步输出在像素层面足够逼真（<a href=\"https://github.com/G-U-N/Awesome-Consistency-Models\">来源：综述与社区资料</a>）。这是个漂亮的回归——对抗当年输在训练不稳，如今只当&quot;细节补偿&quot;的辅助项，扬长避短。2024–2026 年的前沿（如 TLCM、自校正流蒸馏、SiD 分数蒸馏）多是把一致性、对抗、整流流重流三者组合，把少步质量进一步逼近多步教师。</p>\n<h2 id=\"整流流与-拉直轨迹\">整流流与&quot;拉直轨迹&quot;</h2><p>第三条思路从源头下手。少步难，根因是 ODE 轨迹弯曲——弯的路用大步长积分必然失真。<a href=\"../foundations/score-based-sde\">基于分数的生成与 SDE</a> 介绍的整流流（Rectified Flow）通过&quot;重流（reflow）&quot;操作反复用模型自己的生成样本重训，让轨迹一步步变直；轨迹越直，越少的步数就能高保真积分，理论上完全笔直时一步即精确。截至 2025 年，整流流加重流已是 PeRFlow、SlimFlow 等高效模型的基础，也是 SD3、FLUX 这类原生整流流模型天然少步友好的原因（<a href=\"https://www.emergentmind.com/topics/rectified-flow-matching\">来源：Rectified Flow Matching 综述</a>）。</p>\n<p>需要厘清的是蒸馏与采样器优化的关系：<a href=\"samplers-schedulers\">采样器与调度</a> 不改权重、随时可用、上限二十步左右；蒸馏改权重、需训练投入、能下探到一步。二者正交，实践中常叠加——先蒸出一个少步模型，再配高阶求解器跑那几步。无论怎么加速，无分类器引导都得跟着重新考量，因为蒸馏后引导的行为会变，这层在<a href=\"classifier-free-guidance\">无分类器引导</a> 收尾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"蒸馏的代价与常见误区\">蒸馏的代价与常见误区</h2><p>少步越快，代价越大——蒸馏不是免费的加速，而是把成本从推理挪到了训练：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法族</th>\n<th>加速幅度</th>\n<th>训练成本</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>渐进蒸馏</td>\n<td>中（4–8 步）</td>\n<td>需多轮折半训练</td>\n<td>误差逐步累积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性模型</td>\n<td>高（1–4 步）</td>\n<td>需从头或蒸馏训练</td>\n<td>一步设定下细节偏软</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>潜在一致性 LCM</td>\n<td>高（2–4 步）</td>\n<td>潜空间蒸馏，较省</td>\n<td>受底座潜空间质量限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对抗蒸馏 ADD</td>\n<td>高（1–4 步）</td>\n<td>需判别器，训练不稳</td>\n<td>对抗易失衡，需仔细配权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整流流重流</td>\n<td>高（1–4 步）</td>\n<td>需反复重训拉直</td>\n<td>重流轮数多，流程偏重</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对应的常见误区是：以为&quot;蒸馏就是压步数、质量无损&quot;（少步必然以部分细节或多样性为代价）；以为&quot;蒸一次可以套到所有底座&quot;（多数蒸馏绑定特定教师权重，LCM-LoRA 这类可插拔方案正是为破此局限而生）；以及以为&quot;蒸馏之后引导照旧&quot;（学生模型对引导尺度的响应会变，必须重调）。</p>\n<p>一个实用的判断是：如果目标只是把 50 步压到 20 步，用高阶采样器即可、无需蒸馏；只有当需求下探到个位数步，蒸馏的训练投入才真正划算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>高阶求解器到个位数步会因轨迹弯曲崩溃；蒸馏改训一个学生模型，直接学&quot;一步跳到终点&quot;，突破这一下界。</li>\n<li>一致性模型强制 ODE 轨迹上各点映同一起点，支持一步生成也支持多步换质量，可蒸馏亦可独立训练。</li>\n<li>LCM 把一致性蒸馏搬进潜空间得到 2–4 步模型，LCM-LoRA 更把加速做成可插拔插件；ADD/SD-Turbo 用判别器补偿一步细节。</li>\n<li>整流流靠重流拉直轨迹从源头降低步数需求，是 SD3、FLUX 原生少步友好的根源。</li>\n<li>蒸馏与采样器优化正交可叠加，且都需与无分类器引导协同重调。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"蒸馏与少步采样","id":"蒸馏与少步采样"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：用慢教师教出快学生","id":"核心概念-用慢教师教出快学生"},{"level":2,"text":"一致性模型：让轨迹处处自洽","id":"一致性模型-让轨迹处处自洽"},{"level":2,"text":"潜在一致性与对抗蒸馏","id":"潜在一致性与对抗蒸馏"},{"level":2,"text":"整流流与\"拉直轨迹\"","id":"整流流与-拉直轨迹"},{"level":2,"text":"蒸馏的代价与常见误区","id":"蒸馏的代价与常见误区"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"采样器与调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-models/sampling/samplers-schedulers"},"next":{"title":"无分类器引导","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-models/sampling/classifier-free-guidance"}}